  "solution_ref": "$\\overline{\\mathrm{PQ}}=\\frac{\\sqrt2}3\\cdot3\\sqrt2=2$. $\\overline{\\mathrm{BC}}=\\frac12\\overline{\\mathrm{BC}}+2+\\frac16\\overline{\\mathrm{BC}}$ → $\\overline{\\mathrm{BC}}=6$, $\\overline{\\mathrm{BQ}}=5$. $\\cos B=\\frac{28+25-18}{2\\cdot2\\sqrt7\\cdot5}=\\frac{\\sqrt7}4$. $\\overline{\\mathrm{AC}}^2=28+36-2\\cdot2\\sqrt7\\cdot6\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt7}4=22$. $\\sin B=\\frac34$, $R=\\frac{\\sqrt{22}}{2\\cdot3/4}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{22}}3$. 넓이 $\\frac{88}9\\pi$",
